6)\">Josh 10:26</ref> (twice in verse) (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Esth 5:14\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(17,5,14)\">Esth 5:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 6:4\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(17,6,4)\">Esth 6:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 7:9\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(17,7,9)\">Esth 7:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 7:10\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(17,7,10)\">Esth 7:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 8:7\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,7)\">Esth 8:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 9:13\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,13)\">Esth 9:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 9:25\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,25)\">Esth 9:25</ref>. <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 plural <bdbheb>שָׂרִים בְּיָדָם נִתְלוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 5:12\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(25,5,12)\">Lam 5:12</ref> <highlight>princes have been hung up by their hands; Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>וַיִּתָּלוּ עַלעֵֿץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 2:23\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(17,2,23)\">Esth 2:23</ref> <highlight>they were hanged on a tree</highlight>; + 3 masculine singular with apocope <bdbheb>וַיִּתָּל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 18:9\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,9)\">2Sam 18:9</ref> (for <bdbheb>וַיּתַֻּן</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>נתן</reflink></bdbheb> <b>Hoph`al</b>). <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>hang up</highlight> for display, with accusative of thing: <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 plural <bdbheb>תִּלּוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:10\" b=